'''Abyss Gazers''' (深淵を覗く者 ''Shin'en o Nozoku Mono'', '''Abyss Gazers''') is the 6th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 55th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 7.3 Update|version 7.3]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is relatively easy compared to some of the previous ones. Simple strategies will make short work of the levels.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Lowkey]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy with very high health and range, rapid attacks and a 100% chance to Curse, but extremely slow movement speed.

